### 六、高频同义替换词组

#### 1. 表示"重要"
- important, significant, crucial, vital, essential, critical, key, fundamental

#### 2. 表示"增加"
- increase, rise, grow, expand, boost, enhance, escalate, surge

#### 3. 表示"减少"
- decrease, decline, diminish, reduce, drop, fall, shrink, dwindle

#### 4. 表示"认为"
- think, believe, argue, contend, assert, maintain, claim, hold

#### 5. 表示"导致"
- cause, lead to, result in, contribute to, give rise to, bring about

#### 6. 表示"显示"
- show, indicate, demonstrate, reveal, suggest, illustrate, display
